<div class="wp-block-group"><!-- wp:columns -->
<div class="wp-block-columns"><!-- wp:column -->
<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:heading {"level":1,"style":{"typography":{"textAlign":"left"}}} -->
<h1 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-left">Weddings that tell your story</h1>
<!-- /wp:heading --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column -->
<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>A wedding is not just an event. It is the convergence of two families, two histories, two dreams becoming one. We understand this weight, this significance. Our approach to wedding photography is rooted in patience and observation. We arrive early, we stay late, and we watch for the moments that matter most.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We capture the nervous smile before the ceremony begins. The way your mother's eyes fill with tears. The unguarded laughter between old friends. These are the frames that will matter in ten years, in twenty years, when the details fade but the feeling remains.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Our team works seamlessly across multiple venues and lighting conditions. We use natural light whenever possible, letting the day unfold as it should. When we do use artificial light, it serves the moment, never dominates it.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We deliver more than photographs. We deliver a chronicle of your day told through our eyes, our instincts, our commitment to honoring what you have built together.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Fifteen featured images from our wedding portfolio showcase the range of emotions, traditions, and celebrations we have been privileged to document.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

