<div class="wp-block-group"><!-- wp:heading {"level":1} -->
<h1 class="wp-block-heading">The moments that matter</h1>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>A wedding is a story told in light and shadow. We capture the first look, the vows exchanged, the tears and laughter that make a day unforgettable. These fifteen images represent the essence of what we do—finding the truth in celebration. From the bride's quiet moment before walking down the aisle to the final dance under the stars, every frame holds weight. We work without pretense, letting the day unfold naturally while staying ready for the decisive moment. Your wedding deserves more than documentation. It deserves a legacy.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

